As you know, the gremlin's "curse" attack can remove some of your
intrinsics. But it can only remove intrinsics on a certain hard-coded
list - the intricacies of which mean that they can't steal sleep
resistance, shock resistance, and quite a lot of rare intrinsics as
well.

http://www.greyfire.org/~l/attrcurse.diff

With this patch they can now remove intrinsic...
 * sleep resistance
 * teleport control
 * polymorphing
 * polymorph control
 * shock resistance
 * disintegration resistance
 * warning
 * searching
 * restful sleep
 * protection from shape changers
 * magical breathing
 * regeneration
 * hunger
 * conflict
 * damage bonus/penalty
 * accuracy bonus/penalty

Note that this doesn't apply to polymorph-conferred intrinsics.
Because, like, a fire elemental without fire resistance is both
impossible and dumb.

Also, check out some of the hallucination messages that nobody will
ever see.

